msgid "USB U 盘与键盘鼠标"
msgstr "USB Drives, Keyboards, and Mice"

msgid "控制器与设备"
msgstr "Controllers and Devices"

msgid ""
"默认内核内置 xHCI、EHCI 和 UHCI。xHCI 支持根端口或 Hub 后的 USB 3.x SuperSpeed BOT/SCSI 存储，以及"
" USB 2.0/1.x BOT 存储、boot HID 键盘和相对 鼠标。EHCI 支持 USB 2.0 高速 BOT/SCSI "
"存储；低速/全速键鼠可由 UHCI companion 提供。VMware 中可选择“USB Controller / USB "
"Compatibility / USB 3.x”使用 xHCI，或选择 USB 2.0 使用 EHCI；两种路径的验证结果分别记录。 USB 的 "
"Linux 块设备与 evdev 接口由内核提供，不需要修改 BusyBox。"
msgstr ""
"The default kernel has xHCI, EHCI, and UHCI built in. xHCI supports USB 3.x "
"SuperSpeed BOT/SCSI storage on root ports or behind hubs, as well as USB "
"2.0/1.x BOT storage, boot HID keyboards, and relative mice. EHCI supports "
"USB 2.0 high-speed BOT/SCSI storage; low/full-speed keyboards and mice can "
"use a UHCI companion. In VMware, select USB Controller / USB Compatibility /"
" USB 3.x for xHCI, or USB 2.0 for EHCI; verification results for the two "
"paths are recorded separately. The kernel provides Linux block-device and "
"evdev interfaces for USB; BusyBox modifications are unnecessary."

msgid ""
"xHCI 支持 USB2／USB3 Hub、多级路由和下游设备热插拔；USB2 的 multi-TT Hub 使用默认 single-TT 模式。拔掉 "
"Hub 时，下游设备一起断开，旧打开不会 转向重新插入的设备。UAS、stream、等时音视频及非 boot HID 不受支持。 "
"USB4、Type-C/PD 和物理电气认证也不在支持范围内。SuperSpeedPlus 可按已验证的控制器协议能力识别速率，但日志中的 "
"``bps`` 是控制器声明的 链路速率，不是实测吞吐量；10/20 Gb/s 物理链路尚未验证。"
msgstr ""
"xHCI supports USB2/USB3 hubs, multilevel routing, and downstream hotplug. "
"USB2 multi-TT hubs use the default single-TT mode. Unplugging a hub "
"disconnects its downstream devices; old opens never redirect to reinserted "
"devices. UAS, streams, isochronous audio/video, and non-boot HID are "
"unsupported. USB4, Type-C/PD, and physical electrical certification are also"
" outside scope. SuperSpeedPlus rates can be identified according to verified"
" controller protocol capabilities, but ``bps`` in logs is the controller-"
"declared link rate, not measured throughput. Physical 10/20 Gb/s links "
"remain unverified."

msgid ""
"接管固件配置的 xHCI 时，驱动只在必要寄存器几何推导出的边界内访问扩展 能力，不对正在使用的 BAR 做破坏性尺寸探测。这依赖固件对必要寄存器和 "
"BAR 范围的描述真实；无法确认边界内的能力会被拒绝。"
msgstr ""
"When taking over firmware-configured xHCI, the driver accesses extended "
"capabilities only within bounds derived from required register geometry and "
"does not destructively probe the size of an in-use BAR. This relies on "
"accurate firmware descriptions of required registers and BAR ranges; "
"capabilities that cannot be confirmed within bounds are rejected."

msgid ""
"存储当前要求 512 字节逻辑扇区，支持 GPT、MBR/扩展分区和直接在整个设备上 创建的文件系统。没有介质的读卡器、更换介质需重新拔插。不是所有 "
"USB 协议都受支持，例如 UAS、等时音视频和非 boot HID 设备；文件系统类型还 必须有相应内核实现。"
msgstr ""
"Storage currently requires 512-byte logical sectors and supports GPT, "
"MBR/extended partitions, and filesystems created directly on the whole "
"device. Card readers without media, or media changes, require unplugging and"
" reconnecting. Not all USB protocols are supported, including UAS, "
"isochronous audio/video, and non-boot HID devices; filesystem types also "
"require corresponding kernel implementations."

msgid "Fileman 桌面操作"
msgstr "Fileman Desktop Operations"

msgid ""
"Fileman 左侧的“设备”列表自动发现可移动存储卷，后台约每两秒刷新一次。 "
"点击卷名或“打开”后挂载并进入文件夹，已挂载卷前显示星号。支持已有驱动可读的 FAT32、exFAT、ext2 和 "
"ext4。分区介质与整盘文件系统均可使用。当前存储驱动的 逻辑扇区要求仍为 512 字节。"
msgstr ""
"The Devices list on Fileman's left side automatically discovers removable "
"storage volumes and refreshes in the background about every two seconds. "
"Clicking a volume name or Open mounts it and enters its folder; mounted "
"volumes have an asterisk prefix. FAT32, exFAT, ext2, and ext4 readable by "
"existing drivers are supported, on partitioned media or as whole-device "
"filesystems. Current storage drivers still require 512-byte logical sectors."

msgid ""
"挂载点使用 ``/run/media/<数字 UID>/<设备名>-<diskseq>``，由 root 创建。 普通用户通过现有 sudo / "
"ReliefAskpass 密码窗口授权，需要相应 sudo 权限。 FAT32/exFAT 使用 Linux "
"``uid/gid/fmask/dmask`` 挂载选项，为发起用户提供读写权限。 ext 文件系统保留介质自身的 POSIX "
"所有权与模式。挂载同时启用 ``nosuid,nodev``。 设备身份通过 sysfs 和 ``BLKGETDISKSEQ`` "
"复核。拔插后需要重新选择新介质。"
msgstr ""
"Mount points use ``/run/media/<数字 UID>/<设备名>-<diskseq>`` and are created by "
"root. Regular users authorize through the existing sudo / ReliefAskpass "
"password dialog and need appropriate sudo privileges. FAT32/exFAT use Linux "
"``uid/gid/fmask/dmask`` mount options to grant the initiating user "
"read/write access. ext filesystems retain the medium's POSIX ownership and "
"modes. Mounts also enable ``nosuid,nodev``. Device identity is rechecked "
"through sysfs and ``BLKGETDISKSEQ``. After reconnection, the new medium must"
" be selected again."

msgid ""
"拔出前选择卷并点击“弹出”。Fileman 离开当前设备目录，然后后台卸载该设备的 各个挂载点并同步设备缓存。成功提示“现在可以安全拔出设备”后，可拔出"
" U 盘或 在 VMware 中断开对应 USB 设备。物理供电由设备连接控制。 "
"系统挂载受到保护。文件、工作目录、映射或裸块设备使用者造成占用时，界面报告 失败，并在可枚举时列出相关进程 PID。关闭使用者后可以重试。部分卷已卸载而"
" 后续卷失败时，设备列表按实际挂载状态刷新，仍需完成弹出后再拔出。"
msgstr ""
"Before unplugging, select the volume and click Eject. Fileman leaves the "
"current device directory, then unmounts that device's mount points and syncs"
" its cache in the background. After the success message says the device can "
"safely be removed, unplug the USB drive or disconnect the corresponding USB "
"device in VMware. Physical power is controlled by the device connection. "
"System mounts are protected. If files, working directories, mappings, or raw"
" block-device users keep it busy, the interface reports failure and lists "
"related process PIDs when enumerable. Close those users and retry. If some "
"volumes unmount but a later one fails, the device list reflects actual mount"
" state; finish ejecting before unplugging."

msgid "设备发现、挂载和卸载均使用独立子进程，Fileman 窗口继续处理事件。 正在执行设备操作时，关闭窗口会提示等待完成。"
msgstr ""
"Device discovery, mounting, and unmounting all use separate child processes,"
" so Fileman's window continues handling events. Closing the window during a "
"device operation prompts you to wait for completion."

msgid "命令行挂载"
msgstr "Command-Line Mounting"

msgid ""
"设备使用普通 ``/dev/sdX`` 名称，分区带数字后缀；编号取决于机器原有磁盘， 不可假定所有 U 盘都是 ``sdb``。先用 "
"``lsblk`` 查看设备、容量和文件系统， 确认目标后以 root 执行。重新连接后名称可能改变，应再次确认设备。 下面的 ``sdX1`` "
"是占位符，必须换成实际分区："
msgstr ""
"Devices use ordinary ``/dev/sdX`` names, with numeric suffixes for "
"partitions. Numbering depends on existing disks; do not assume every USB "
"drive is ``sdb``. First use ``lsblk`` to inspect devices, capacities, and "
"filesystems, verify the target, and then run as root. Names may change after"
" reconnection, so verify the device again. ``sdX1`` below is a placeholder "
"and must be replaced with the actual partition:"

msgid ""
"ext4/exFAT 介质分别使用 ``-t ext4`` 或 ``-t exfat``；整个设备上直接创建的 文件系统使用 "
"``/dev/sdX``。写保护介质使用 ``mount -o ro``。卸载完成后再 断开 VMware 可移动设备或拔出 U "
"盘；突然拔出后的旧打开返回 ``ENODEV``， 重新插入不会把旧句柄转向新设备。"
msgstr ""
"Use ``-t ext4`` or ``-t exfat`` for ext4/exFAT media respectively; "
"filesystems created directly on the whole device use ``/dev/sdX``. Use "
"``mount -o ro`` for write-protected media. Complete unmounting before "
"disconnecting a VMware removable device or unplugging a USB drive. After "
"sudden removal, old opens return ``ENODEV``; reinsertion does not redirect "
"old handles to the new device."

msgid ""
"如果设备无法证明写入已落盘，并且拒绝缓存同步命令，``umount`` 会报告错误。 应保留设备连接并检查日志；不能把文件能够读回当成安全断电的证明。 "
"此类设备重新连接后，可使用 ``mount -o ro`` 读取；从未尝试写入的设备无需 提交本驱动的写缓存，读取后的卸载不会被不支持的同步命令阻断。"
msgstr ""
"If a device cannot prove writes reached persistent storage and rejects cache"
" synchronization commands, ``umount`` reports an error. Keep it connected "
"and inspect logs; successful readback alone is not proof of safe power "
"removal. After reconnecting such a device, ``mount -o ro`` can be used to "
"read it. A device on which no write was attempted needs no write-cache "
"commit from this driver, so unmounting after reading is not blocked by an "
"unsupported sync command."

msgid "使用模块配置时"
msgstr "With Modular Configuration"

msgid ""
"``make defconfig`` 默认将驱动内置。选择 ``CONFIG_USB_XHCI_HCD=m`` 或 "
"``CONFIG_USB_EHCI_HCD=m`` 后，镜像分别携带 ``xhci.ko`` 或 ``ehci.ko`` 和 对应 PCI "
"alias，由现有模块冷插拔策略加载。EHCI 的低速/全速根端口键鼠还 需要 UHCI companion；相应设置和其他模块管理步骤见 "
":doc:`kernel-modules`。 USB 设备的使用者持有对应控制器模块；有挂载或打开的 USB 块设备时卸载 "
"该控制器会返回忙。应先卸载文件系统、关闭使用者，不强制卸载。重新连接 后的 ``/dev/sdX`` 名称可能变化，旧打开不会被重新绑定。"
msgstr ""
"``make defconfig`` builds drivers in by default. Selecting "
"``CONFIG_USB_XHCI_HCD=m`` or ``CONFIG_USB_EHCI_HCD=m`` puts ``xhci.ko`` or "
"``ehci.ko`` and corresponding PCI aliases in the image, loaded by the "
"existing module coldplug policy. EHCI low/full-speed root-port keyboards and"
" mice also need a UHCI companion. For settings and other module management "
"steps, see :doc:`kernel-modules`. USB device users hold the corresponding "
"controller module; unloading it returns busy while USB block devices are "
"mounted or open. First unmount filesystems and close users; do not force "
"unloading. Reconnection may change ``/dev/sdX`` names; old opens are not "
"rebound."

msgid "集成验证"
msgstr "Integration Verification"

msgid ""
"``tools/test_usb2_qemu.py`` 消费 ReliefNT 的原生输入/移除探针，在关闭 PS/2 控制器的 QEMU 中检查 "
"USB 键盘登录、相对鼠标精确事件、U 盘读写和写保护、 MBR/GPT/整盘 FAT、拔插后旧 FD 的 "
"``ENODEV``、新设备名及可选模块装卸。 离线核对写入字节；镜像使用只读快照，测试 U 盘与输出目录新建，不接管宿主机 物理 "
"USB。探针哈希、内核 release、固件、控制器、QMP 设备树及每个设备的 端口与协商速率记录在输出中；xHCI 检查要求每个 U 盘实际协商 "
"``SUPER``， 不能仅凭设备连接到 xHCI 或其他设备的速率判定成功。"
msgstr ""
"``tools/test_usb2_qemu.py`` uses ReliefNT's native input/removal probe in "
"QEMU with the PS/2 controller disabled. It checks USB keyboard login, exact "
"relative-mouse events, USB-drive read/write and write protection, "
"MBR/GPT/whole-disk FAT, ``ENODEV`` on old FDs after reconnection, new device"
" names, and optional module loading/unloading. Written bytes are checked "
"offline. The image uses a read-only snapshot, and test drives and output "
"directories are newly created; host physical USB is not taken over. Output "
"records probe hashes, kernel release, firmware, controller, QMP device tree,"
" and each device's port and negotiated rate. xHCI checks require every USB "
"drive to actually negotiate ``SUPER``; attachment to xHCI or another "
"device's rate alone cannot establish success."

msgid ""
"默认仍是 ``--topology highspeed --firmware bios``；``companion`` 保留 EHCI / UHCI "
"行为。选择 ``qemu-xhci`` 或 ``nec-usb-xhci`` 时，各配置八个 USB2 和 八个 USB3 根端口；``--hid-"
"usb-version 1`` 和 ``2`` 分别检查 FULL 和 HIGH 键鼠，默认使用 ``2``。``--modules`` "
"检查所选控制器模块，需使用对应模块化 镜像。xHCI 测试要求独立探针身份 JSON 中的 ``probe_sha256`` 与实际探针 "
"一致；默认查找探针同目录下的 ``probe-identity.json``，也可用 ``--probe-identity`` "
"指定。必须为每行选择全新的输出目录："
msgstr ""
"The default remains ``--topology highspeed --firmware bios``; ``companion`` "
"preserves EHCI/UHCI behavior. Selecting ``qemu-xhci`` or ``nec-usb-xhci`` "
"configures eight USB2 and eight USB3 root ports for each. ``--hid-usb-"
"version 1`` and ``2`` check FULL and HIGH keyboards/mice respectively, with "
"``2`` as default. ``--modules`` checks the selected controller module and "
"requires the corresponding modular image. xHCI tests require "
"``probe_sha256`` in a separate probe identity JSON to match the actual "
"probe. The default is ``probe-identity.json`` beside the probe; ``--probe-"
"identity`` can override it. Choose a new output directory for every row:"

msgid ""
"UEFI 使用 ``QEMU_FIRMWARE`` 指定的 OVMF 镜像，默认 "
"``/usr/share/edk2/x64/OVMF.4m.fd``，通过 ``-bios`` 只读取共享固件文件。 测试设置 "
"``opt/ovmf/X-PciMmio64Mb=0``，使 NVMe 64 位 BAR 放入低 MMIO 窗口，与 "
"``tools/test_dual_boot_qemu.py`` 的低 MMIO 模式一致。BIOS 使用 SeaBIOS "
"的对应低地址设置。结果文件记录原始镜像运行前后的 SHA-256； 只有 guest 检查、离线字节检查和镜像不变均通过，整行才通过。"
msgstr ""
"UEFI uses the OVMF image specified by ``QEMU_FIRMWARE``, defaulting to "
"``/usr/share/edk2/x64/OVMF.4m.fd``, reading the shared firmware file only "
"through ``-bios``. The test sets ``opt/ovmf/X-PciMmio64Mb=0`` to place NVMe "
"64-bit BARs in the low MMIO window, matching the low-MMIO mode of "
"``tools/test_dual_boot_qemu.py``. BIOS uses the corresponding SeaBIOS low-"
"address setting. Results record SHA-256 of the original image before and "
"after execution; a row passes only if guest checks, offline byte checks, and"
" image immutability all pass."

msgid ""
"完整验收矩阵包括 builtin 的 qemu-xhci/BIOS/HIGH HID、 nec-usb-xhci/UEFI/FULL HID，模块化 "
"qemu-xhci/BIOS/FULL HID，以及原有 EHCI/UHCI companion 回归。各行是否运行和通过以其 "
"``results.json`` 为准。 真实 VMware xHCI 曾观察到虚拟 SuperSpeed 存储及 FULL 键鼠枚举，但当前集成 "
"验证未完成，不能据此声称存储、输入和缓存同步全部成功；以往 VMware USB2 失败仍按原结果记录。物理 USB 直通和实体硬件尚未验证。QEMU "
"的 ``-vga vmware`` 也不代表真实 VMware 验证。"
msgstr ""
"The full acceptance matrix includes built-in qemu-xhci/BIOS/HIGH HID, nec-"
"usb-xhci/UEFI/FULL HID, modular qemu-xhci/BIOS/FULL HID, and the existing "
"EHCI/UHCI companion regression. Whether each row ran and passed is "
"determined by its ``results.json``. Actual VMware xHCI has shown enumeration"
" of virtual SuperSpeed storage and FULL keyboards/mice, but current "
"integration verification is incomplete; this cannot establish successful "
"storage, input, and cache synchronization. Historical VMware USB2 failures "
"retain their original results. Physical USB passthrough and real hardware "
"remain unverified. QEMU's ``-vga vmware`` does not constitute actual VMware "
"verification either."

msgid ""
"``tools/test_xhci_hub_qemu.py`` 另行验证两级全速 Hub 后的 U 盘、USB 键盘 登录和相对鼠标、单独 U "
"盘拔插、整棵 Hub 树移除／重建，以及可选 ``--modules`` 的挂载阻止卸载和卸载后重新枚举。使用 console backend 的测试 "
"副本，避免 XDM 在 TTY 键盘验证期间切换焦点。该脚本同样消费匹配镜像的 ``--manifest``、内核仓原生 "
"``--probe``，并要求新建 ``--output``："
msgstr ""
"``tools/test_xhci_hub_qemu.py`` separately verifies USB drives, USB keyboard"
" login, and relative mice behind two levels of full-speed hubs, individual "
"drive removal/reinsertion, removal/recreation of the entire hub tree, and "
"optional ``--modules`` checks for mounts preventing unloading and re-"
"enumeration after unloading. It uses a console-backend test copy to prevent "
"XDM from switching focus during TTY keyboard checks. This script also uses "
"an image-matching ``--manifest`` and the kernel repository's native "
"``--probe``, and requires a new ``--output``:"

msgid ""
"QEMU 的 ``usb-hub`` 只支持全速，不能用它证明高速 Hub 的 TT 或 USB3 Hub 物理链路。内核支持边界和硬件协议验证归属 "
"ReliefNT 文档；Hub 的 VMware 验证未完成，物理 USB 直通和实体 Hub 也尚未验证。"
msgstr ""
"QEMU's ``usb-hub`` supports full speed only and cannot prove high-speed hub "
"TT operation or USB3 hub physical links. Kernel support boundaries and "
"hardware protocol verification belong to ReliefNT documentation. VMware hub "
"verification is incomplete; physical USB passthrough and real hubs are also "
"unverified."

msgid ""
"VMware 的 USB 兼容性和可移动设备操作见 `Workstation Pro 官方手册 "
"<https://techdocs2-prod.adobecqms.net/content/dam/broadcom/techdocs/us/en/pdf/vmware/desktop-"
"hypervisors/workstation/vmware-workstation-pro-17-0.pdf>`_。"
msgstr ""
"For VMware USB compatibility and removable-device operations, see the "
"`official Workstation Pro manual "
"<https://techdocs2-prod.adobecqms.net/content/dam/broadcom/techdocs/us/en/pdf/vmware/desktop-"
"hypervisors/workstation/vmware-workstation-pro-17-0.pdf>`_."
